  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Symbiosis.MilitaryAid.Failed.DeploymentImpossible>{0}当前无法在该战场部署有效援军。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Symbiosis.MilitaryAid.Failed.DeploymentImpossible>

